    gmeow:expectedViolationCode "shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent" ;
    gmeow:conformanceRationale "The counter-example omits math:preservationLaw on a math:GroupHomomorphism (sh:minCount 1 on math:HomomorphismShape), so validation MUST emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent and NO other finding (math:UnderspecifiedHomomorphism)." .

