    gmeow:expectedOutcome gmeow:conforms ;
    gmeow:conformanceRationale "A math:Series naming math:seriesTerm and carrying a math:Convergence (math:convergesTo + math:convergenceMode) satisfies math:SeriesShape and math:ConvergenceShape and validates with no findings." .

